            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devi specificare la tabella e poi i nomi delle colonne tra parentesi quadre.</p><p>Non seguire l'ordine delle colonne fa finire i valori nelle colonne sbagliate.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE orders( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int, &#xA; price int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO orders(name, id, price) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Chocolate box&quot;, 1235, 14); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO orders(name, id, price) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Bath bombs&quot;, 2337, 9); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO orders(name, id, price) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Flower hamper&quot;, 7483, 21);\"><tables><table name=\"orders\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /><header content=\"price\" /></row><row><data content=\"Chocolate box\" /><data content=\"1235\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row><row><data content=\"Bath bombs\" /><data content=\"2337\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row><row><data content=\"Flower hamper\" /><data content=\"7483\" /><data content=\"21\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" orders(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", price) \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Teddy bear&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6574\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" orders;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /><header content=\"price\" /></row><row><data content=\"Chocolate box\" /><data content=\"1235\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row><row><data content=\"Bath bombs\" /><data content=\"2337\" /><data content=\"9\" /></row><row><data content=\"Flower hamper\" /><data content=\"7483\" /><data content=\"21\" /></row><row><data content=\"Teddy bear\" /><data content=\"6574\" /><data content=\"13\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>orders</code>, seguito da <code>name,</code> e poi <code>id,</code>, <code>price</code>.</p></body></html>"
